  "title": "India's Extradition of Sheikh Hasina to Bangladesh",
  "summary": "The Indian High Commissioner to Bangladesh confirmed that Sheikh Hasina's extradition request is under examination, highlighting ongoing legal processes. India maintains that the extradition is well-structured and legal, while acknowledging the government's role in supporting the process.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Sheikh Hasina, 79, has been living in India after fleeing Bangladesh in August 2024 following the collapse of her government.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "India's external affairs ministry has maintained that the extradition is being examined through established processes.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Dinesh Trivedi, the Indian High Commissioner, stated that there is no deadline for her return to Bangladesh.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
